on of Ca<sup>2&#x0002b;</sup> waves in isolated cardiomyocytes. <source>Biophys J</source><volume>66</volume>: <fpage>1756</fpage>&#x02013;1762, <year>1994</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8075316</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r10"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Geerts</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name>, Bovendeerd P, Nicolay K, Arts T. Characterization of the normal cardiac myofiber field in goat measured with MR-diffusion tensor imaging. <source>Am J Physiol Heart Circ Physiol</source><volume>283</volume>: <fpage>H139</fpage>&#x02013;H145, <year>2002</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12063284</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r11"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Gennerich</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, Schild D. Anisotropic diffusion in mitral cell dendrites revealed by fluorescence correlation spectroscopy. <source>Biophys J</source><volume>83</volume>: <fpage>510</fpage>&#x02013;522, <year>2002</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12080138</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r12"><label>12</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>De Graaf</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name>, van Kranenburg A, Nicolay K. In vivo <sup>31</sup>P-NMR diffusion spectroscopy of ATP and phosphocreatine in rat skeletal muscle. <source>Biophys J</source><volume>78</volume>: <fpage>1657</fpage>&#x02013;1664, <year>2000</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10733948</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r13"><label>13</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>DK</given-names></name>, Horsfield MA, Simmons A. Optimal strategies for measuring diffusion in anisotropic systems by magnetic resonance imaging. <source>Magn Reson Med</source><volume>42</volume>: <fpage>515</fpage>&#x02013;525, <year>1999</year>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10467296</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="r1